WEBVTT

00:30:27.708 --> 00:30:31.906
AG: If someone is pushing you
to fit their idea of your authentic self,

00:30:31.930 --> 00:30:34.326
especially if it's based on stereotypes,

00:30:34.350 --> 00:30:36.676
something has gone very wrong.

00:30:36.700 --> 00:30:40.418
AM: I'm just curious --
I mean, have you ever gotten any of this?

00:30:42.030 --> 00:30:44.974
Have you ever been
sort of given the sense --

00:30:44.998 --> 00:30:46.045
AG: (Laughs)

00:30:46.069 --> 00:30:49.443
AM: ... that you could be something
other than the way you are?

00:30:51.092 --> 00:30:52.243
AG: No.

00:30:52.267 --> 00:30:54.774
I mean, every once in a while
I get suggestions

00:30:54.798 --> 00:30:57.479
like, "You should move
less like a Muppet."

00:30:57.503 --> 00:30:58.956
AM: (Laughs)

00:30:58.980 --> 00:31:01.057
AG: But that's more objective,